OL,3,GNEWSAChief fears lives will be lost in
OL,4,Afuture wildfires
OL,5,
OL,6,FA senior fire chief has warned lives
OL,7,Fcould be lost in future wildfires - and
OL,8,Fthat the devastating blaze which
OL,9,Fdestroyed homes in Stourbridge could
OL,10,Fjust as easily have happened in
OL,11,FHerefordshire or Worcestershire.
OL,13,FDave Swallow, group commander at
OL,14,FHereford and Worcester Fire and Rescue
OL,15,FService, said he fully expected the UK
OL,16,Fto see similar scenes again.
OL,18,FNineteen homes were destroyed when fire
OL,19,Fswept through Stourbridge on the
OL,20,Fhottest day of the year in August,
OL,21,Fwhile another blaze in Pershore left
OL,22,Ftwo families homeless.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,356,350,200,160,0,100
